sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant T as Sweep timer
  participant S as ReconciliationStore
  participant P as Provider (observe only)
  participant D as classifyDrift
  participant O as control.outbox
  participant C as Control API projection

  T->>S: claimStaleInstances(25, now - 5m)
  Note over S: FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED, and last_reconciled_at<br/>stamped inside the claim so a parallel replica skips these.
  S-->>T: Candidates with desired state

  loop Each candidate
    T->>P: ObserveInstance(resource, expected markers)
    P-->>T: exists, power state, ownership, resources
    T->>D: desired vs observed
    D-->>T: classification + dangerous flag
    T->>S: recordObservation(outcome)
    alt Drift found
      S->>O: drift.detected to reconciliation.events.v1
      O->>C: Debezium then Kafka
      C->>C: Record classification on the instance document
    else No drift
      Note over S: Instance updated, nothing published.<br/>A quiet sweep does not fill the topic with non-news.
    end
  end

  Note over T,C: Nothing here corrects anything. The store has no method<br/>that destroys, shrinks, detaches, or overwrites (SAFE-029),<br/>and the client exposes exactly one RPC.
